    "name": "Hunting Seas",
    "steam_appid": 3024080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024080/extras/6a1e67504818035b210d78bbe9324f0c.avif?t=1738005546\" width=620 height=160 /></span><br>Hunting Seas is a Dark Turn Based Boss Hunt which has you leading a fleet of ships harboring the last remnants of humanity; survivals of a now flooded world.<br><br>As the Fleet Admiral, you decide how to use scarce available resources and answer the most vital question: To hunt or hide?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024080/extras/6b8f855b5103d39e503aa8ff6f4baae9.avif?t=1738005546\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Manage the fleet resources:</strong> build &amp; repair ships, feed the crew and promote captains.<br></li><li><strong>Hunt giant sea creatures</strong> in tactical turn-based naval battles.<br></li><li><strong>Be careful to survive: </strong>a single bump from such creatures can sink your fragile ships.<br></li><li><strong>Strategize to prevail:</strong> use Instant Skills to build up your attack plan and finish it with powerful Casted Skills.<br></li><li><strong>Customize your hunting fleet: </strong>Assign Captains to your ships and create unique skill sets to increase their odds of staying alive.<br></li><li><strong>Collect the spoils of the hunt</strong>, meat and bones, the only remaining resources of this new world. <br></li><li><strong>Sail across the seven seas: </strong>hunt or be hunted by different and unique sea creatures.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024080/extras/6a1e67504818035b210d78bbe9324f0c.avif?t=1738005546\" width=620 height=160 /></span><br>Hunting Seas is a Dark Turn Based Boss Hunt which has you leading a fleet of ships harboring the last remnants of humanity; survivals of a now flooded world.<br><br>As the Fleet Admiral, you decide how to use scarce available resources and answer the most vital question: To hunt or hide?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024080/extras/6b8f855b5103d39e503aa8ff6f4baae9.avif?t=1738005546\" width=620 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Manage the fleet resources:</strong> build &amp; repair ships, feed the crew and promote captains.<br></li><li><strong>Hunt giant sea creatures</strong> in tactical turn-based naval battles.<br></li><li><strong>Be careful to survive: </strong>a single bump from such creatures can sink your fragile ships.<br></li><li><strong>Strategize to prevail:</strong> use Instant Skills to build up your attack plan and finish it with powerful Casted Skills.<br></li><li><strong>Customize your hunting fleet: </strong>Assign Captains to your ships and create unique skill sets to increase their odds of staying alive.<br></li><li><strong>Collect the spoils of the hunt</strong>, meat and bones, the only remaining resources of this new world. <br></li><li><strong>Sail across the seven seas: </strong>hunt or be hunted by different and unique sea creatures.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Hunting Seas is a Dark Turn-based Boss Hunt RPG. In a flooded world plagued by deep sea horrors, lead a fleet of ship to survival. Hunt larger than life creatures; use their meat and bones to feed your crew; Sail and discover the secrets of the sea...",
